---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Web Design Paphos | Websites That Convert"
  description="Fast, beautiful, conversion-focused websites for businesses in Paphos and Cyprus. Local SEO, mobile-first, built to grow your business."
  canonical="https://webdesignpaphos.github.io/"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero bg-cream">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">Web Design Paphos</span>
      <h1>Web Design Paphos That Turns Clicks Into Customers</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Your website is your hardest-working employee — it never sleeps, never takes a break, and it's the first thing people see. We build fast, beautiful, conversion-focused websites for businesses across Paphos and Cyprus.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get Your Free Consultation &rarr;</a>
      <p class="hero-note">No obligation. No jargon. Just a website that works.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
  <section class="bg-white" id="problem">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">The Problem</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Is Your Website Quietly Costing You Business?</h2>
      <p>Most business owners in Paphos know they need a strong website — but the reality falls short. Maybe yours loads slowly and people leave before it even appears. Maybe it looks broken on a phone, where most of your visitors actually are. Maybe it's buried on page five of Google, or maybe you have no site at all.</p>
      <p>Here's the hard truth: every day this goes unfixed, potential customers are clicking away — and landing on a competitor who simply made it easier to find and trust them.</p>
      <p>You don't have a traffic problem. You have a first impression problem. And it's fixable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROMISE -->
  <section class="bg-beige" id="promise">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">The Promise</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Imagine a Website That Works While You Sleep</h2>
      <p>Picture this: a customer searches for what you offer, finds you at the top, clicks through to a site that loads instantly and looks stunning on their phone. Within seconds they trust you — and they get in touch.</p>
      <p>That's not luck. That's what proper web design paphos is supposed to do. Not just a pretty page, but a machine that quietly turns strangers into enquiries, day and night.</p>
      <p>We promise a website you're genuinely proud to share, built around your goals, and designed from the ground up to convert.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE SOLUTION / PROCESS -->
  <section class="bg-white" id="process">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">The Solution</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>How We Turn Your Site Into a Growth Engine</h2>
      <p>Our approach to web design paphos comes down to three things: understanding your business, knowing your customers, and designing with real purpose.</p>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>We Listen</h3>
            <p>We start by learning what makes you different, who you're trying to reach, and what a win looks like for you — more calls, more bookings, more sales. No two businesses are the same, so no two sites should be either.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>We Design &amp; Build</h3>
            <p>Then we craft a clean, modern, custom website tailored to your brand. Every page is fast, mobile-first, and effortless to navigate. We build in solid SEO foundations from day one, so your site doesn't just look good — it gets found.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>You Grow</h3>
            <p>We launch it, test it, and make sure everything runs smoothly. From there, your website starts doing its job: bringing you enquiries while you focus on running your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE DO / SERVICES -->
  <section class="bg-dark" id="services">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">What We Do</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Everything Your Business Needs Online</h2>

      <ul class="services">
        <li>
          <p class="service-title">Custom Website Design</p>
          <p class="service-desc">Unique, branded designs built for your business, never recycled templates.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="service-title">Mobile-First Development</p>
          <p class="service-desc">Flawless on every phone, tablet, and laptop, because that's where your customers are.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="service-title">Local SEO</p>
          <p class="service-desc">Built to rank in Paphos and across Cyprus, so the right people find you first.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="service-title">Speed Optimisation</p>
          <p class="service-desc">Lightning-fast load times that keep visitors from bouncing.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="service-title">Ongoing Support</p>
          <p class="service-desc">Updates, tweaks, and a real person to talk to whenever you need one.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO WE HELP -->
  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">Who We Help</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Perfect For Growing Businesses in Paphos</h2>
      <p>Whether you run a restaurant, a law firm, a beauty salon, a construction company, or a holiday rental, our web design paphos service is built to fit. We work with startups launching their first site and established businesses ready to leave an outdated one behind.</p>
      <p>If you want a website that pulls its weight, you're in the right place.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
  <section class="bg-dark-2" id="why">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">Why Choose Us</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Why Businesses Trust Our Web Design Paphos Service</h2>

      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Lightning fast — every site is optimised to load in the blink of an eye</li>
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Found on Google — local SEO baked in from the start</li>
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Custom, not copied — designs that reflect your brand and stand out</li>
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Mobile-first — perfect on the devices your customers actually use</li>
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Real, human support — talk to a person, never a ticket number</li>
        <li><span class="check-mark">&#10003;</span> Built to convert — every element designed to turn visitors into enquiries</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">FAQ</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Questions? We've Got Answers</h2>

      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How long does it take to build my website?</h3>
          <p>Most projects launch within 2–4 weeks, depending on size and how quickly we get your content. We'll give you a clear timeline upfront.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How much does a website cost?</h3>
          <p>Every project is different, so we quote based on your needs. Book a free consultation and we'll give you an honest, transparent price — no surprises.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Will my website show up on Google?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Solid SEO foundations are part of every build, so your site is set up to be found by customers searching in Paphos and beyond.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I update the website myself?</h3>
          <p>Absolutely. We build sites you can manage easily, and we're always here if you'd rather we handle it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>What if I already have a website?</h3>
          <p>No problem — we'll assess what you have and either refresh it or rebuild it into something far stronger.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GUARANTEE -->
  <section class="bg-beige">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">No Risk</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>No Risk, No Pressure</h2>
      <p>Your first consultation is completely free and comes with zero obligation. We'll talk through your goals, show you what's possible, and give you honest advice — whether you work with us or not.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="bg-dark" id="contact">
    <div class="inner">
      <span class="label">Get Started</span>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
      <h2>Ready For a Website That Grows Your Business?</h2>
      <p>Stop losing customers to a slow, outdated, or invisible website. Whether you're starting fresh or upgrading, our web design paphos team is ready to help you stand out, get found, and get booked.</p>

      <form class="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xkjwaalr" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://webdesignpaphos.github.io/thank-you/" />
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required />
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required />
        <input type="text" name="business" placeholder="Type of Business" />
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your website project..."></textarea>
        <div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Get My Free Consultation &rarr;</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 7rem 2rem 6rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .hero-note { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a8957e; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { padding: 5rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
  }
</style>
